/* Tutorial 03: Zeek + Splunk Network Baselining. Examples are illustrative and have not been executed against a live Splunk deployment. */
window.DCI_TUTORIAL_ZEEK_SPLUNK = (() => {
 const sections=[{"id":"scope","title":{"en":"1. Sensor visibility and data validation","ko":"1. 센서 가시성과 데이터 확인"},"html":{"en":"<p>Zeek sees only traffic reaching its sensor. Check SPAN/TAP, VLANs, NAT, collection gaps and duplicate sensors before inferring topology.</p><pre><code>index=zeek earliest=-24h\n| stats count by sourcetype\n| sort - count</code></pre>","ko":"<p>Zeek는 센서에 도달한 트래픽만 관찰합니다. SPAN/TAP, VLAN, NAT, 수집 누락, 중복 센서를 먼저 확인합니다.</p><pre><code>index=zeek earliest=-24h\n| stats count by sourcetype\n| sort - count</code></pre>"}},{"id":"hosts","title":{"en":"2. Discover observed private IPs","ko":"2. 관찰된 사설 IP 발견"},"html":{"en":"<p>Combine both endpoints; observations count appearances, not unique sessions. RFC1918 is only a discovery heuristic, not proof of organizational ownership.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval ip=mvappend('id.orig_h','id.resp_h')\n| mvexpand ip\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,ip)\n| stats count AS observations by ip\n| sort ip</code></pre>","ko":"<p>출발지와 목적지를 모두 펼쳐 IP를 찾습니다. observations는 등장 횟수이며 고유 세션 수가 아닙니다. 사설 IP는 조직 소유의 증거가 아닙니다.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval ip=mvappend('id.orig_h','id.resp_h')\n| mvexpand ip\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,ip)\n| stats count AS observations by ip\n| sort ip</code></pre>"}},{"id":"subnets","title":{"en":"3. Group subnet candidates","ko":"3. 서브넷 후보 그룹화"},"html":{"en":"<p>Grouping into /24 buckets does not prove the actual subnet mask. Verify with DHCP, routing, IPAM or firewall configurations.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval ip=mvappend('id.orig_h','id.resp_h')\n| mvexpand ip\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,ip)\n| eval subnet_24=ipmask(&quot;255.255.255.0&quot;,ip)\n| stats dc(ip) AS unique_hosts count AS observations by subnet_24\n| sort - unique_hosts</code></pre>","ko":"<p>/24 단위 그룹화는 실제 서브넷 마스크를 증명하지 않습니다. DHCP, 라우팅, IPAM, 방화벽 설정으로 검증하세요.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval ip=mvappend('id.orig_h','id.resp_h')\n| mvexpand ip\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,ip)\n| eval subnet_24=ipmask(&quot;255.255.255.0&quot;,ip)\n| stats dc(ip) AS unique_hosts count AS observations by subnet_24\n| sort - unique_hosts</code></pre>"}},{"id":"roles","title":{"en":"4. Identify service providers","ko":"4. 서버 및 서비스 제공 호스트 식별"},"html":{"en":"<p>A DNS client also generates DNS traffic; identify server candidates by destinations receiving requests from many distinct clients.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| rename id.orig_h AS src_ip id.resp_h AS dest_ip id.resp_p AS dest_port\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections dc(src_ip) AS unique_clients values(service) AS services by dest_ip dest_port proto\n| sort - unique_clients</code></pre>","ko":"<p>DNS 클라이언트도 DNS 통신을 많이 생성합니다. 여러 클라이언트가 접속하는 목적지 IP와 포트를 분석해 서버 후보를 찾습니다.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| rename id.orig_h AS src_ip id.resp_h AS dest_ip id.resp_p AS dest_port\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections dc(src_ip) AS unique_clients values(service) AS services by dest_ip dest_port proto\n| sort - unique_clients</code></pre>"}},{"id":"dc","title":{"en":"5. Find domain controller candidates","ko":"5. Domain Controller 후보 찾기"},"html":{"en":"<p>Look for combinations of Kerberos (88), LDAP (389/636), SMB (445), password changes (464), and Global Catalog (3268/3269). Corroborate with Zeek kerberos and DNS SRV records; ports alone do not confirm a DC.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| rename id.orig_h AS src_ip id.resp_h AS dest_ip id.resp_p AS dest_port\n| where dest_port IN (88,389,445,464,636,3268,3269)\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats dc(src_ip) AS unique_clients count AS connections values(dest_port) AS observed_ports dc(dest_port) AS port_diversity by dest_ip\n| sort - port_diversity - unique_clients</code></pre>","ko":"<p>Kerberos(88), LDAP(389/636), SMB(445), 암호 변경(464), Global Catalog(3268/3269) 조합을 찾습니다. Kerberos 로그와 DNS SRV 응답으로 교차 검증하세요.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| rename id.orig_h AS src_ip id.resp_h AS dest_ip id.resp_p AS dest_port\n| where dest_port IN (88,389,445,464,636,3268,3269)\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.0.0.0/8&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;172.16.0.0/12&quot;,dest_ip) OR cidrmatch(&quot;192.168.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats dc(src_ip) AS unique_clients count AS connections values(dest_port) AS observed_ports dc(dest_port) AS port_diversity by dest_ip\n| sort - port_diversity - unique_clients</code></pre>"}},{"id":"kerberos","title":{"en":"6. Verify Kerberos servers","ko":"6. Kerberos 서버 검증"},"html":{"en":"<p>Many clients contacting the same KDC is supporting evidence. Check the actual field extraction and the available zeek_kerberos sourcetype first.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_kerberos earliest=-7d\n| rename id.orig_h AS client_ip id.resp_h AS server_ip\n| stats count AS kerberos_events dc(client_ip) AS unique_clients values(request_type) AS request_types by server_ip\n| sort - kerberos_events</code></pre>","ko":"<p>여러 클라이언트가 동일 KDC에 접속한다면 DC 후보의 근거가 됩니다. zeek_kerberos 로그와 필드 추출을 먼저 확인하세요.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_kerberos earliest=-7d\n| rename id.orig_h AS client_ip id.resp_h AS server_ip\n| stats count AS kerberos_events dc(client_ip) AS unique_clients values(request_type) AS request_types by server_ip\n| sort - kerberos_events</code></pre>"}},{"id":"protocols","title":{"en":"7. Profile protocols and applications","ko":"7. 프로토콜 및 애플리케이션 분석"},"html":{"en":"<p>proto is the transport protocol; service is Zeek's detected application protocol and may be missing or contain multiple services. Do not equate a port with a verified application.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval app_service=if(isnull(service) OR service=&quot;&quot; OR service=&quot;-&quot;,&quot;unknown&quot;,service)\n| stats count AS connections dc('id.orig_h') AS unique_sources dc('id.resp_h') AS unique_destinations by proto app_service\n| sort - connections</code></pre>","ko":"<p>proto는 전송 계층 프로토콜이며 service는 Zeek가 식별한 애플리케이션입니다. service가 비어 있거나 여러 값일 수 있으며 포트만으로 앱을 확정하지 마세요.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval app_service=if(isnull(service) OR service=&quot;&quot; OR service=&quot;-&quot;,&quot;unknown&quot;,service)\n| stats count AS connections dc('id.orig_h') AS unique_sources dc('id.resp_h') AS unique_destinations by proto app_service\n| sort - connections</code></pre>"}},{"id":"directions","title":{"en":"8. Classify traffic direction","ko":"8. 내부·외부 통신 방향 분류"},"html":{"en":"<p>Replace 10.10.0.0/16 with confirmed organization-owned ranges. orig is the initiator, not automatically internal. Outside this CIDR does not necessarily mean public Internet.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| eval src_internal=cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip), dest_internal=cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| eval traffic_type=case(src_internal AND dest_internal,&quot;Internal-to-Internal&quot;,src_internal AND NOT dest_internal,&quot;Outbound&quot;,NOT src_internal AND dest_internal,&quot;Inbound&quot;,true(),&quot;Outside-defined-range&quot;)\n| stats count AS connections dc(src_ip) AS unique_sources dc(dest_ip) AS unique_destinations by traffic_type\n| sort - connections</code></pre>","ko":"<p>10.10.0.0/16은 반드시 확인된 조직 CIDR로 교체하세요. orig는 연결 시작 측이지 항상 내부가 아닙니다. 내부 범위 밖이 반드시 인터넷은 아닙니다.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| eval src_internal=cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip), dest_internal=cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| eval traffic_type=case(src_internal AND dest_internal,&quot;Internal-to-Internal&quot;,src_internal AND NOT dest_internal,&quot;Outbound&quot;,NOT src_internal AND dest_internal,&quot;Inbound&quot;,true(),&quot;Outside-defined-range&quot;)\n| stats count AS connections dc(src_ip) AS unique_sources dc(dest_ip) AS unique_destinations by traffic_type\n| sort - connections</code></pre>"}},{"id":"eastwest","title":{"en":"9. Map East-West relationships","ko":"9. East-West 내부 통신 관계"},"html":{"en":"<p>Discover internal client-server pairs and unusual workstation-to-workstation SMB/RDP. Byte fields may be absent in some pipelines; verify orig_ip_bytes and resp_ip_bytes first.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip) AND cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections sum(orig_ip_bytes) AS bytes_sent sum(resp_ip_bytes) AS bytes_received values(service) AS services by src_ip dest_ip id.resp_p\n| sort - connections\n| head 50</code></pre>","ko":"<p>내부 클라이언트-서버 쌍과 워크스테이션 간 SMB/RDP를 찾습니다. orig_ip_bytes와 resp_ip_bytes 필드가 실제로 수집되는지 확인하세요.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip) AND cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections sum(orig_ip_bytes) AS bytes_sent sum(resp_ip_bytes) AS bytes_received values(service) AS services by src_ip dest_ip id.resp_p\n| sort - connections\n| head 50</code></pre>"}},{"id":"outbound","title":{"en":"10. Profile outbound sessions","ko":"10. Outbound 외부 통신 분석"},"html":{"en":"<p>Examine external peers, destination ports, volume, DNS names and periodicity. IP-layer bytes include headers; orig_bytes/resp_bytes are payload counts.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip) AND NOT cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections sum(orig_ip_bytes) AS outbound_bytes sum(resp_ip_bytes) AS inbound_bytes values(service) AS services by src_ip dest_ip id.resp_p\n| sort - connections\n| head 50</code></pre>","ko":"<p>외부 목적지, 포트, 전송량, DNS 이름, 주기성을 분석합니다. IP 계층 바이트에는 헤더가 포함되며 orig_bytes/resp_bytes는 페이로드 기준입니다.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| where cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip) AND NOT cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections sum(orig_ip_bytes) AS outbound_bytes sum(resp_ip_bytes) AS inbound_bytes values(service) AS services by src_ip dest_ip id.resp_p\n| sort - connections\n| head 50</code></pre>"}},{"id":"inbound","title":{"en":"11. Profile inbound sessions","ko":"11. Inbound 유입 통신 분석"},"html":{"en":"<p>Identify destination hosts and ports contacted by sources outside your defined network. NAT and sensor placement may hide internal addresses; conn_state helps distinguish failed attempts.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| where NOT cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip) AND cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections dc(src_ip) AS unique_sources values(service) AS services values(conn_state) AS connection_states by dest_ip id.resp_p\n| sort - connections</code></pre>","ko":"<p>정의된 내부 범위 밖에서 접속하는 목적지와 포트를 찾습니다. NAT와 센서 위치에 따라 주소가 달라질 수 있으며 conn_state로 실패한 연결도 구분하세요.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-7d\n| eval src_ip='id.orig_h', dest_ip='id.resp_h'\n| where NOT cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,src_ip) AND cidrmatch(&quot;10.10.0.0/16&quot;,dest_ip)\n| stats count AS connections dc(src_ip) AS unique_sources values(service) AS services values(conn_state) AS connection_states by dest_ip id.resp_p\n| sort - connections</code></pre>"}},{"id":"trend","title":{"en":"12. Establish a behavioral baseline","ko":"12. 시간대별 정상 패턴 설정"},"html":{"en":"<p>Collect at least several business cycles where possible; include weekdays, weekends, backups and patch windows. Compare new peers, protocols and connection volumes.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-30d\n| timechart span=1d count AS connections</code></pre>","ko":"<p>가능하면 여러 업무 주기를 수집하고 평일·주말·백업·패치 일정을 포함하세요. 새로운 목적지, 프로토콜, 연결량 변화를 비교합니다.</p><pre><code>index=zeek sourcetype=zeek_conn earliest=-30d\n| timechart span=1d count AS connections</code></pre>"}}];
 return {id:'tutorial-zeek-splunk',index:'03',title:{en:'Zeek + Splunk: Network Baselining',ko:'Zeek + Splunk: 네트워크 베이스라이닝'},summary:{en:'Discover hosts, subnet candidates, domain controllers, protocols and East-West / North-South traffic with copy-ready SPL.',ko:'SPL로 호스트·서브넷 후보·DC·프로토콜·내부 및 외부 통신을 단계별로 분석합니다.'},meta:{en:{meta:'Tutorial 03 · Zeek / Splunk',review:'Illustrative SPL · adapt to your environment'},ko:{meta:'튜토리얼 03 · Zeek / Splunk',review:'교육용 SPL · 실제 환경에 맞게 수정 필요'}},sections,sources:[{title:'Zeek conn.log reference',url:'https://docs.zeek.org/en/current/logs/conn.html'},{title:'Splunk Search Reference',url:'https://docs.splunk.com/Documentation/Splunk/latest/SearchReference/WhatsInThisManual'},{title:'RFC 1918 Private Address Space',url:'https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1918'}]};
})();
